<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="site-nav"><div class="wrap nav-inner"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Bhavin J. Shah home">BHAVIN J. SHAH<small>COACH FOR LIFE</small></a><nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Page navigation"><a href="#self-check">Is this for me?</a><a href="#takeaways">The session</a><a href="#stories">Success stories</a><a href="#coach">Your coach</a></nav><a class="button nav-cta" href="#register">Reserve my seat <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero" id="top"><img class="hero-photo" src="https://bhavinjshah.com/uploads/uyp_coach_speaking_1782819283.jpg" alt="Bhavin J. Shah working with business owners at Coach For Life" width="1600" height="1200" fetchpriority="high"><div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">A live session for business owners <span class="tag">FREE ENTRY</span></p><h1>Business Growth<br><span>Blueprint.</span></h1><p class="hero-hook">You are not the problem.<br>Your business cannot run without you.</p><p class="hero-copy">Every order, every team issue, every client waits for you. Step back for 3 hours with Bhavin J. Shah. See what needs to change, and where to start.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#register">Reserve my free seat <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a><a class="hero-link" href="#self-check">Does this sound like me? <i data-lucide="arrow-down"></i></a></div><div class="hero-meta"><span><i data-lucide="check"></i> No payment to attend</span><span><i data-lucide="users"></i> A small room of business owners</span></div></div></section>
<div class="session-strip"><div class="wrap session-inner"><div class="session-item"><i data-lucide="calendar-days"></i><div><strong>20 November 2026</strong><small>Friday</small></div></div><div class="session-item"><i data-lucide="clock-3"></i><div><strong>8:55 AM - 11:55 AM</strong><small>3 hours · India Standard Time</small></div></div><div class="session-item"><i data-lucide="map-pin"></i><div><strong>Coach For Life, Surat</strong><small>Bhatar · In-person session</small></div></div><div class="session-item"><i data-lucide="ticket"></i><div><strong>Free introductory session</strong><small>Seat confirmation by our team</small></div></div></div>
<section class="section check-section" id="self-check"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">A moment of honesty</p><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Is your business growing,<br>or just keeping you busy?</h2><p class="intro">Tick what feels familiar. Your answers help us understand where you need clarity.</p></div></div><div class="check-grid" id="selfCheck">
<label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" value="I cannot step away from the business"><span>You started the business for freedom. Now you cannot leave it.</span></label>
<label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" value="Sales depend on my constant effort"><span>Sales happen only when you push. You stop, sales stop.</span></label>
<label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" value="My team depends on me"><span>Your team cannot run the business for three days without you.</span></label>
<label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" value="Retaining good people is difficult"><span>Good people join. They do not stay.</span></label>
<label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" value="Plans change but growth does not"><span>You keep changing the plan. Sales stay the same.</span></label>
<label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" value="Work follows me home"><span>You come home, but the business is still in your head.</span></label>
<label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" value="Others are growing in the same market"><span>Someone in the same line is growing. Same market. You are stuck.</span></label>
<label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" value="I need help identifying the bottleneck"><span>You know something needs to change. You cannot name it yet.</span></label>
</div><div class="check-result"><p id="checkStatus" aria-live="polite"><strong>0 selected.</strong> Start with what is true for you.</p><a class="button secondary" href="#register">Find my starting point <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section pattern-band"><div class="wrap pattern-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Look beneath the symptoms</p><h2>Different problems.<br>A connected pattern.</h2><p class="intro">Sales, staff, long hours and stress at home can all point to the same thing: a business built around the owner. This session helps you examine that pattern.</p></div><div><div class="belief"><strong>“Only I can do this.”</strong><span>What happens to the work when you are not there?</span></div><div class="belief"><strong>“Customers want only me.”</strong><span>Can your team build the same confidence with customers?</span></div><div class="belief"><strong>“I work 14-16 hours.”</strong><span>Which decisions and tasks still sit only on your desk?</span></div><div class="belief"><strong>“The market is difficult.”</strong><span>What can you change inside the business, starting now?</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="takeaways"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Three hours. A clearer direction.</p><h2>Leave knowing what to do first.</h2><p class="intro">A practical conversation about your business, followed by priorities you can take back to work.</p><ol class="outcomes" style="list-style:none;padding:0"><li class="outcome"><p class="number">01 / IDENTIFY</p><h3>Find the real bottleneck</h3><p>Separate market challenges, team issues and your own working patterns.</p></li><li class="outcome"><p class="number">02 / DELEGATE</p><h3>Get work off your desk</h3><p>Identify the first responsibility that should not depend only on you.</p></li><li class="outcome"><p class="number">03 / BUILD</p><h3>Move beyond the daily push</h3><p>Explore why sales slow down when you stop, and what a repeatable system needs.</p></li><li class="outcome"><p class="number">04 / ACT</p><h3>Plan your next 90 days</h3><p>Choose two or three priorities in the right order. Make the next step clear.</p></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="section fit"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">The right room matters</p><h2>For the person who runs the business.</h2><div class="fit-grid"><div><h3>This session is for you if...</h3><ul class="fit-list"><li><i data-lucide="check"></i>You are an owner, partner or key decision-maker.</li><li><i data-lucide="check"></i>You run a manufacturing, trading, retail, service or professional business.</li><li><i data-lucide="check"></i>Your business is operating, but growth feels stuck.</li><li><i data-lucide="check"></i>You are ready to look at how you lead, delegate and make decisions.</li></ul></div><div><h3>Know what you are signing up for.</h3><ul class="fit-list"><li><i data-lucide="users"></i>A focused, live conversation with a small group of owners.</li><li><i data-lucide="clock-3"></i>Three uninterrupted hours, in person in Surat.</li><li><i data-lucide="notebook-pen"></i>Reflection and practical priorities for your own business.</li><li><i data-lucide="video-off"></i>No recording. Please apply only if you can attend live.</li></ul></div></div><p class="fit-note">The introductory session is free. A separate, optional paid workshop may be discussed. Attending this session does not commit you to a purchase.</p></div></section>
<section class="section" id="stories"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Hear from the community</p><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Real experiences.<br>In their own words.</h2><p class="intro">Participants share their experiences with Coach For Life workshops.</p></div></div><div class="story-grid">
<article class="story"><a class="video-thumb" href="https://youtu.be/h7qgJxwzDz4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-video="h7qgJxwzDz4" aria-label="Play participant story 1"><img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/h7qgJxwzDz4/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Coach For Life participant sharing a workshop experience" width="480" height="270" loading="lazy"><span class="play-icon"><i data-lucide="play"></i></span></a><div class="story-copy"><h3>A participant's perspective</h3><p>Hear a first-hand experience from the Coach For Life community.</p><a href="https://youtu.be/h7qgJxwzDz4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the story <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div></article>
<article class="story"><a class="video-thumb" href="https://youtu.be/NClcXbwJmNY" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-video="NClcXbwJmNY" aria-label="Play participant story 2"><img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NClcXbwJmNY/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Coach For Life participant testimonial" width="480" height="270" loading="lazy"><span class="play-icon"><i data-lucide="play"></i></span></a><div class="story-copy"><h3>Insights beyond the session</h3><p>A workshop participant reflects on their learning and experience.</p><a href="https://youtu.be/NClcXbwJmNY" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the story <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div></article>
<article class="story"><a class="video-thumb" href="https://youtu.be/86nU6Up8pwM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-video="86nU6Up8pwM" aria-label="Play participant story 3"><img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/86nU6Up8pwM/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Participant talking about Coach For Life" width="480" height="270" loading="lazy"><span class="play-icon"><i data-lucide="play"></i></span></a><div class="story-copy"><h3>Another journey, shared</h3><p>Discover what taking time to work on yourself can mean.</p><a href="https://youtu.be/86nU6Up8pwM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the story <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div></article>
</div><figure class="quote-strip"><blockquote>“Just completed a workshop named Unleash Your Hidden Potential. It was an amazing workshop. It gave me a new vision for my professional and personal life.”</blockquote><figcaption><p>Abhijit Chhajed · Coach For Life workshop participant</p></figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="section room" id="room"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Inside Coach For Life</p><h2>A real room.<br>Space to think differently.</h2></div><div class="gallery-controls"><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-gallery="-1" aria-label="Previous workshop photo" title="Previous photo"><i data-lucide="arrow-left"></i></button><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-gallery="1" aria-label="Next workshop photo" title="Next photo"><i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></button></div></div><div class="gallery" tabindex="0" aria-label="Workshop photos, scroll to browse"><figure><img src="https://bhavinjshah.com/uploads/uyp_coach_speaking_1782819283.jpg" alt="Bhavin J. Shah leading a live workshop with participants" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Learning together, in person.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://bhavinjshah.com/uploads/uyp_group_photo_1782818113.webp" alt="Bhavin J. Shah with a Coach For Life workshop group" width="600" height="450" loading="lazy"><figcaption>People, conversations and new perspectives.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://bhavinjshah.com/uploads/uyp_activity_photo_1782818297.webp" alt="Participants taking part in a Coach For Life workshop activity" width="600" height="450" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Taking part. Reflecting. Moving forward.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://bhavinjshah.com/uploads/uyp_gallery_2_1782818079.webp" alt="A moment from a previous Coach For Life session" width="600" height="450" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Moments from previous workshops.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="coach"><div class="wrap coach-grid"><figure class="coach-photo"><img src="https://bhavinjshah.com/assets/admin-defaults/coach_portrait.jpg" alt="Bhavin J. Shah, Life and Business Coach" width="600" height="750" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Bhavin J. Shah · Founder, Coach For Life</figcaption></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">Your coach</p><h2>Bhavin J. Shah</h2><p class="intro">Life &amp; Business Coach</p><p class="coach-quote">“1 Life = 1 Mission = CONTRIBUTION.”</p><p class="intro">Coach For Life began with 10-15 people in 2011. Since then, Bhavin has worked with business owners and individuals across India and internationally in Dubai, Bangkok and Hong Kong.</p><p class="intro">In this session, he brings the conversation back to your business: how it depends on you, what gets in the way, and the first step towards change.</p><div class="coach-stats"><div><strong>2011</strong><span>Coach For Life founded</span></div><div><strong>500+</strong><span>One-to-one coaching</span></div><div><strong>100+</strong><span>Workshops led</span></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section register" id="register"><div class="wrap register-grid"><div class="register-summary"><p class="eyebrow">Your next step starts here</p><h2>Make time to work<br>on your business.</h2><p class="intro">Request your free seat for Business Growth Blueprint. Share a little about yourself and your business so our team can confirm your place.</p><div class="event-detail"><i data-lucide="calendar-days"></i><div><strong>Friday, 20 November 2026</strong><small>8:55 AM - 11:55 AM IST</small></div></div><div class="event-detail"><i data-lucide="map-pin"></i><div><strong>Coach For Life, Bhatar, Surat</strong><small>D-107, 2nd Floor, SNS Interio, near Bhatar Cross Roads, next to CNG Pump, Surat 395017.</small><small><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Coach+For+Life+SNS+Interio+Bhatar+Surat" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View directions</a></small></div></div><div class="event-detail"><i data-lucide="ticket"></i><div><strong>Free introductory session</strong><small>No payment is needed to apply.</small></div></div><div class="event-detail"><i data-lucide="phone"></i><div><strong>Need help?</strong><small><a href="tel:+918401840170">+91 84018 40170</a></small></div></div></div>
<div class="form-panel"><form id="registrationForm" action="./" method="post" novalidate><div class="form-progress" aria-label="Registration progress"><span class="step-label active" id="progress1" aria-current="step">01 · About you</span><span class="step-label" id="progress2">02 · Your business</span></div><div class="hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this empty<input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><input type="hidden" name="request_id" id="requestId"><input type="hidden" name="self_check" id="selfCheckValue">
<div id="step1"><h3 tabindex="-1" id="step1Title">Let's start with you.</h3><p class="form-hint">Your contact details for session confirmation.</p><div class="field-grid"><div class="field wide"><label for="name">Full name</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="100" required aria-describedby="nameError"><span class="field-error" id="nameError"></span></div><div class="field wide"><label for="phone">WhatsApp number <span class="optional">(India +91)</span></label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel-national" maxlength="20" placeholder="10-digit mobile number" required aria-describedby="phoneError"><span class="field-error" id="phoneError"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="city">City</label><input id="city" name="city" autocomplete="address-level2" maxlength="100" required aria-describedby="cityError"><span class="field-error" id="cityError"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Email <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="180" aria-describedby="emailError"><span class="field-error" id="emailError"></span></div><div class="field wide"><label for="decision">Your role in the business</label><select id="decision" name="decision" required aria-describedby="decisionError"><option value="">Select your role</option><option>Owner / Partner</option><option>Decision-maker</option><option value="Other">Employee / Student / Exploring</option></select><span class="field-error" id="decisionError"></span></div></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button dark" type="button" id="continueButton">Continue <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></button></div><p class="privacy-note">Your details are used to respond to this registration and coordinate the session.</p></div>
<div id="step2" hidden><h3 tabindex="-1" id="step2Title">Tell us about your business.</h3><p class="form-hint">A few details to make the conversation relevant to you.</p><div class="field-grid"><div class="field wide"><label for="business_name">Business name <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label><input id="business_name" name="business_name" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="180"><span class="field-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="business_type">Business type</label><select id="business_type" name="business_type" required aria-describedby="business_typeError"><option value="">Select type</option><option>Manufacturing</option><option>Trading / Wholesale</option><option>Retail</option><option>Service business</option><option>Agency / Professional firm</option><option>Other running business</option></select><span class="field-error" id="business_typeError"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="years_in_business">Years in business</label><select id="years_in_business" name="years_in_business" required aria-describedby="years_in_businessError"><option value="">Select range</option><option>0-2 years</option><option>3-7 years</option><option>8-15 years</option><option>15+ years</option></select><span class="field-error" id="years_in_businessError"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="annual_turnover">Annual turnover</label><select id="annual_turnover" name="annual_turnover" required aria-describedby="annual_turnoverError"><option value="">Select range</option><option value="Under Rs 50 lakh">Under ₹50 lakh</option><option value="Rs 50 lakh - 2 crore">₹50 lakh - ₹2 crore</option><option value="Rs 2 - 10 crore">₹2 crore - ₹10 crore</option><option value="Rs 10 crore+">₹10 crore+</option><option>Prefer to discuss</option></select><span class="field-error" id="annual_turnoverError"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="team_size">Team size</label><select id="team_size" name="team_size" required aria-describedby="team_sizeError"><option value="">Select range</option><option>Just me</option><option>2-10</option><option>11-50</option><option>50+</option></select><span class="field-error" id="team_sizeError"></span></div><div class="field wide"><label for="main_challenge">Your biggest challenge right now</label><select id="main_challenge" name="main_challenge" required aria-describedby="main_challengeError"><option value="">Select a challenge</option><option>Sales are not growing</option><option>The team depends on me</option><option>Retaining good people</option><option>Work-life balance</option><option>Slow decision-making</option><option>Other business challenge</option></select><span class="field-error" id="main_challengeError"></span></div></div><label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" id="consent" value="yes" required aria-describedby="consentError"><span>I agree to be contacted by Coach For Life by phone or WhatsApp about this session and my registration.</span></label><span class="field-error" id="consentError"></span><div class="form-actions"><button class="button secondary back-button" id="backButton" type="button" aria-label="Back to your contact details" title="Back"><i data-lucide="arrow-left"></i></button><button class="button" id="submitButton" type="submit">Request my free seat <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></button></div><p class="privacy-note">Your seat is confirmed when our team contacts you. No payment now.</p></div><p class="form-status" id="formStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><noscript><p>Please enable JavaScript to complete the form, or call <a href="tel:+918401840170">+91 84018 40170</a> to register.</p></noscript></form>
<div class="success-state" id="successState" hidden><div class="success-icon"><i data-lucide="check"></i></div><h3 id="successTitle" tabindex="-1">Your request is received.</h3><p>Thank you. The Coach For Life team will contact you to confirm your seat for <strong>20 November 2026</strong>.</p><p>Please keep 8:55 AM - 11:55 AM free. We look forward to meeting you in Surat.</p><a class="button" id="calendarLink" download="business-growth-blueprint.ics">Add to my calendar <i data-lucide="calendar-plus"></i></a><a class="button secondary" href="https://wa.me/918401840170?text=Hello%2C%20I%20have%20applied%20for%20Business%20Growth%20Blueprint%20on%2020%20November%202026." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact the team <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a><p class="success-reference" id="successReference"></p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="questions"><div class="wrap faq-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Before you join</p><h2>A few things you may be wondering.</h2><div class="faq"><details open><summary>Is the introductory session really free?</summary><p>Yes. There is no fee to attend Business Growth Blueprint. After the intro, an optional paid workshop, Unleash Your Hidden Potential / Business Growth Mastery, may be discussed. The reference workshop fee is ₹99,000; the team will confirm current pricing and any applicable taxes before you choose to enrol.</p></details><details><summary>What happens after I fill the form?</summary><p>Our team receives your registration and contacts you by phone or WhatsApp to confirm your seat and share the session details. Submitting the form is a request, not an automatic seat confirmation.</p></details><details><summary>Will I get a recording?</summary><p>No. This is a live, in-person session. Please register if you can attend the full three hours on 20 November 2026.</p></details><details><summary>I am not in Surat. Can I attend?</summary><p>Yes, if you can travel to Coach For Life in Bhatar, Surat. Share your city in the form and the team will coordinate with you.</p></details><details><summary>Can my business partner come too?</summary><p>Yes. If both of you make decisions, attending together can be useful. Each person should submit a registration so the team can confirm both seats.</p></details><details><summary>My annual turnover is under ₹50 lakh. Can I apply?</summary><p>Yes. Select your current turnover range honestly. The session is designed for people running a business, and the team will help you assess whether it is the right fit.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need an app or make a payment?</summary><p>No app or payment is needed for this session. Complete the form and wait for our team to confirm your place.</p></details></div></div></section>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap"><div class="footer-grid"><div><a class="brand" href="/">BHAVIN J. SHAH<small>COACH FOR LIFE</small></a><p>Business Growth Blueprint.<br>A clearer direction for your business.</p></div><div><strong>Join us in Surat</strong><p>Friday, 20 November 2026<br>8:55 AM - 11:55 AM IST<br>Coach For Life, Bhatar, Surat</p></div><div><strong>Speak to the team</strong><a href="tel:+918401840170">+91 84018 40170</a><a href="mailto:info@coachforlife.in">info@coachforlife.in</a><a href="/">Visit Bhavin J. Shah's website ↗</a></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 Coach For Life · Bhavin J. Shah</span><span>1 Life = 1 Mission = CONTRIBUTION.</span></div></div></footer>
<div class="mobile-bar"><p>20 Nov · Surat<small>Free live session</small></p><a class="button" href="#register">Reserve my seat <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div>
<dialog id="videoDialog" aria-labelledby="videoTitle"><div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="videoTitle">A Coach For Life experience</h2><button type="button" class="icon-button" id="closeVideo" aria-label="Close video" title="Close video"><i data-lucide="x"></i></button></div><div id="videoContainer"></div><a id="videoFallback" class="video-fallback" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch directly on YouTube ↗</a></dialog>
<script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@0.468.0/dist/umd/lucide.min.js" defer></script>
<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
  if (window.lucide) lucide.createIcons();
  const form = document.getElementById('registrationForm');
  const status = document.getElementById('formStatus');
  const submit = document.getElementById('submitButton');
  const submitLabel = submit.innerHTML;
  const stepOneFields = ['name','phone','city','email','decision'];
  const stepTwoFields = ['business_type','years_in_business','annual_turnover','team_size','main_challenge','consent'];
  let currentStep = 1, busy = false, submitted = false;
  document.getElementById('requestId').value = window.crypto?.randomUUID ? crypto.randomUUID() : Date.now().toString(36) + '-' + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2) + '-' + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2);
  const query = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
  ['utm_source','utm_medium','utm_campaign','utm_content','utm_term'].forEach(key => { const input = document.createElement('input'); input.type='hidden'; input.name=key; input.value=(query.get(key)||'').slice(0,180); form.appendChild(input); });
  const selfChecks = [...document.querySelectorAll('#selfCheck input')];
  function updateChecks() {
    const checked = selfChecks.filter(item=>item.checked);
    const result = document.getElementById('checkStatus');
    result.replaceChildren(); const count = document.createElement('strong'); count.textContent=checked.length+' selected. ';
    result.append(count, document.createTextNode(checked.length>=2?'This session can help you explore these patterns.':checked.length?'That is a useful starting point.':'Start with what is true for you.'));
    document.getElementById('selfCheckValue').value=checked.map(item=>item.value).join('; ');
  }
  selfChecks.forEach(item=>item.addEventListener('change', updateChecks));
  function showStep(step, focus=true) {
    currentStep=step;
    document.getElementById('step1').hidden=step!==1; document.getElementById('step2').hidden=step!==2;
    [1,2].forEach(n=>{const label=document.getElementById('progress'+n);label.classList.toggle('active',n<=step);if(n===step)label.setAttribute('aria-current','step');else label.removeAttribute('aria-current');});
    status.textContent=''; if(focus)document.getElementById('step'+step+'Title').focus({preventScroll:false});
  }
  function fieldError(key, message) { const input=document.getElementById(key), error=document.getElementById(key+'Error'); if(input)input.setAttribute('aria-invalid',message?'true':'false');if(error)error.textContent=message; }
  function validate(keys) {
    let first=null;
    keys.forEach(key=>{ const el=document.getElementById(key); const value=el.value.trim(); let error='';
      if(key==='name'&&value.length<2)error='Enter your full name.';
      else if(key==='city'&&value.length<2)error='Enter your city.';
      else if(key==='phone'){let digits=value.replace(/[\s()+-]/g,'');if(digits.length===12&&digits.startsWith('91'))digits=digits.slice(2);if(!/^[6-9]\d{9}$/.test(digits))error='Enter a valid 10-digit Indian mobile number.';}
      else if(key==='email'&&value&&el.validity.typeMismatch)error='Enter a valid email address or leave this blank.';
      else if(key==='decision'&&value==='Other')error='This session is for business owners and decision-makers. Call the team for other programs.';
      else if(key==='consent'&&!el.checked)error='Please allow the team to contact you about this session.';
      else if(el.required&&!value)error='Please select an option.';
      fieldError(key,error);if(error&&!first)first=el;
    });
    if(first){first.focus();status.textContent='Please check the highlighted details.';return false;}return true;
  }
  document.getElementById('continueButton').addEventListener('click',()=>{status.textContent='';if(validate(stepOneFields))showStep(2);});
  document.getElementById('backButton').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!busy)showStep(1);});
  [...stepOneFields,...stepTwoFields].forEach(key=>document.getElementById(key).addEventListener('input',()=>fieldError(key,'')));
  form.addEventListener('submit',async event=>{
    event.preventDefault();if(busy||submitted)return;
    if(currentStep===1){if(validate(stepOneFields))showStep(2);return;}
    if(!validate(stepOneFields)){showStep(1,false);validate(stepOneFields);return;}
    if(!validate(stepTwoFields))return;
    updateChecks(); busy=true;submit.disabled=true;document.getElementById('backButton').disabled=true;submit.textContent='Sending your request...';form.setAttribute('aria-busy','true');status.textContent='';
    const controller=new AbortController();const timeout=setTimeout(()=>controller.abort(),30000);
    try {
      const response=await fetch(form.action,{method:'POST',body:new FormData(form),signal:controller.signal,headers:{'Accept':'application/json'}});
      const result=await response.json();
      if(!response.ok||!result.ok){if(result.fields){const keys=Object.keys(result.fields);if(keys.some(key=>stepOneFields.includes(key)))showStep(1,false);keys.forEach(key=>fieldError(key,result.fields[key]));document.getElementById(keys[0])?.focus();}throw new Error(result.error||'Your request could not be saved. Please try again.');}
      submitted=true;form.hidden=true;document.getElementById('successState').hidden=false;document.getElementById('successReference').textContent=result.reference?'Registration reference: '+result.reference:'';
      const calendar=['BEGIN:VCALENDAR','VERSION:2.0','PRODID:-//Coach For Life//Business Growth Blueprint//EN','BEGIN:VEVENT','UID:business-growth-blueprint-20261120@bhavinjshah.com','DTSTAMP:'+new Date().toISOString().replace(/[-:]/g,'').replace(/\.\d{3}/,''),'DTSTART:20261120T032500Z','DTEND:20261120T062500Z','SUMMARY:Business Growth Blueprint with Bhavin J. Shah','LOCATION:Coach For Life\\, SNS Interio\\, Bhatar\\, Surat','DESCRIPTION:Free live session. Seat subject to confirmation by Coach For Life. Call +91 84018 40170.','STATUS:TENTATIVE','END:VEVENT','END:VCALENDAR'].join('\r\n');
      document.getElementById('calendarLink').href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([calendar],{type:'text/calendar;charset=utf-8'}));document.getElementById('successTitle').focus();
    } catch(error) {status.textContent=error.name==='AbortError'?'Confirmation is taking longer than expected. Please retry; the same request will not be added twice.':error instanceof SyntaxError?'We could not confirm your request. Please try again or call +91 84018 40170.':error.message||'Connection failed. Check your internet and try again.';}
    finally{clearTimeout(timeout);busy=false;submit.disabled=false;document.getElementById('backButton').disabled=false;submit.innerHTML=submitLabel;form.removeAttribute('aria-busy');}
  });
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-gallery]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const gallery=document.querySelector('.gallery');gallery.scrollBy({left:Number(button.dataset.gallery)*(gallery.querySelector('figure').getBoundingClientRect().width+20),behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches?'instant':'smooth'});}));
  const dialog=document.getElementById('videoDialog');let lastVideoLink;
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-video]').forEach(link=>link.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(!dialog.showModal)return;event.preventDefault();lastVideoLink=link;const iframe=document.createElement('iframe');iframe.src='https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/'+link.dataset.video+'?autoplay=1';iframe.title='Coach For Life participant experience';iframe.allow='autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture';iframe.allowFullscreen=true;document.getElementById('videoContainer').replaceChildren(iframe);document.getElementById('videoFallback').href=link.href;dialog.showModal();}));
  document.getElementById('closeVideo').addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.close());dialog.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(event.target===dialog){const r=dialog.getBoundingClientRect();if(event.clientX<r.left||event.clientX>r.right||event.clientY<r.top||event.clientY>r.bottom)dialog.close();}});dialog.addEventListener('close',()=>{document.getElementById('videoContainer').replaceChildren();lastVideoLink?.focus();});
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
